<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.45 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.45 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.45 percent in the week ending October 5 from 6.34 percent the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	 Oct 5	 Sept 28	Oct 7, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.45	  +6.34	  +8.37</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  316.9	  316.9	  297.7</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended October 7, 1995.</p>
